TRADEMARKS:
  Line and station names appear as factual destination labels. No
  operator logos, symbol marks, station-numbering marks or route-map
  artwork are used. Line colors are a convenience for telling lines
  apart and are not official CI/VI colors. This is an unofficial
  hobby project with no affiliation to any railway operator or company.

